# "If you control four or more Treasures": both players run a Misty Mountains Cold (Bot1 on turn 1, Bot2 on turn 2), so by
# Bot1's chapter III on turn 5 there are five Treasures in play, three Bot1's and two Bot2's. Bot1 controls three, so its Saga is
# not sacrificed and no Dragon comes (an opponent's Treasures are not counted); the scenario
# the-misty-mountains-cold-makes-a-treasure-each-chapter-and-the-fourth-sacrifices-it-for-a-dragon is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
The Misty Mountains Cold
Mountain x3
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
The Misty Mountains Cold
Mountain x3
Mountain x20

